<title id="f1-t">Where each attack enters a remote onboarding check</title>
<desc id="f1-d">Four onboarding steps on the left: personal data, ID document, selfie at the camera, and the app sending media to the service. On the right, the attack that targets each step and the control that stops it: synthetic identity and database checks; altered or AI-made document and document and chip checks; photo, screen or mask and liveness tested under ISO/IEC 30107-3; injected deepfake video and injection detection under CEN/TS 18099.</desc>
<defs><marker id="f1-arr" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10z" fill="var(--muted)"/></marker><marker id="f1-arr-a" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10z" fill="var(--accent)"/></marker></defs>
<rect x="16" y="16" width="250" height="92" rx="14" fill="var(--surface)" stroke="var(--line-strong)" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="34" y="56" font-size="17" font-weight="600" fill="var(--ink)">1. Applicant enters</text><text x="34" y="80" font-size="17" font-weight="600" fill="var(--ink)">personal data</text><rect x="330" y="16" width="294" height="92" rx="14" fill="var(--accent-soft)" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="6 5"/><text x="348" y="46" font-size="16" font-weight="600" fill="var(--ink)">Synthetic identity</text><text x="348" y="69" font-size="14" fill="var(--muted)">Stopped by</text><text x="348" y="91" font-size="15" fill="var(--accent)" font-weight="600">Database checks</text><path d="M330 62.0 L276 62.0" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="5 4" marker-end="url(#f1-arr-a)"/><path d="M141 108 L141 128" stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#f1-arr)"/><rect x="16" y="132" width="250" height="92" rx="14" fill="var(--surface)" stroke="var(--line-strong)" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="34" y="172" font-size="17" font-weight="600" fill="var(--ink)">2. Photo or chip read</text><text x="34" y="196" font-size="17" font-weight="600" fill="var(--ink)">of the ID document</text><rect x="330" y="132" width="294" height="92" rx="14" fill="var(--accent-soft)" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="6 5"/><text x="348" y="162" font-size="16" font-weight="600" fill="var(--ink)">Altered or AI-made document</text><text x="348" y="185" font-size="13" fill="var(--muted)">Stopped by</text><text x="348" y="207" font-size="15" fill="var(--accent)" font-weight="600">Document and chip checks</text><path d="M330 178.0 L276 178.0" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="5 4" marker-end="url(#f1-arr-a)"/><path d="M141 224 L141 244" stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#f1-arr)"/><rect x="16" y="248" width="250" height="92" rx="14" fill="var(--surface)" stroke="var(--line-strong)" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="34" y="288" font-size="17" font-weight="600" fill="var(--ink)">3. Selfie or video</text><text x="34" y="312" font-size="17" font-weight="600" fill="var(--ink)">at the camera</text><rect x="330" y="248" width="294" height="92" rx="14" fill="var(--accent-soft)" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="6 5"/><text x="348" y="278" font-size="16" font-weight="600" fill="var(--ink)">Photo, screen or mask</text><text x="348" y="301" font-size="13" fill="var(--muted)">Stopped by</text><text x="348" y="323" font-size="15" fill="var(--accent)" font-weight="600">Liveness (ISO/IEC 30107-3)</text><path d="M330 294.0 L276 294.0" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="5 4" marker-end="url(#f1-arr-a)"/><path d="M141 340 L141 360" stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#f1-arr)"/><rect x="16" y="364" width="250" height="92" rx="14" fill="var(--surface)" stroke="var(--line-strong)" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="34" y="404" font-size="17" font-weight="600" fill="var(--ink)">4. App sends the</text><text x="34" y="428" font-size="17" font-weight="600" fill="var(--ink)">media to the service</text><rect x="330" y="364" width="294" height="92" rx="14" fill="var(--accent-soft)" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="6 5"/><text x="348" y="394" font-size="16" font-weight="600" fill="var(--ink)">Injected deepfake video</text><text x="348" y="417" font-size="13" fill="var(--muted)">Stopped by</text><text x="348" y="439" font-size="15" fill="var(--accent)" font-weight="600">Injection detection (CEN/TS 18099)</text><path d="M330 410.0 L276 410.0" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="5 4" marker-end="url(#f1-arr-a)"/><path d="M141 456 L141 476" stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#f1-arr)"/><rect x="16" y="480" width="250" height="64" rx="14" fill="var(--ink)"/><text x="34" y="519" font-size="17" font-weight="600" fill="var(--surface)">5. Service decides</text>
</svg>
<figcaption>Each attack enters at a different step, so each needs its own control. A liveness test result says nothing about injected video.</figcaption>
</figure>
